      "summaries": {
        "en": "Moonshine is an open-source automatic speech recognition system optimized for edge devices like smartphones and IoT gadgets, addressing the challenge of running accurate voice recognition with limited computational resources. Its technical innovation lies in using efficient C-based algorithms and model compression techniques to maintain high accuracy while drastically reducing memory and processing requirements. Developers can integrate it into embedded systems for voice commands, transcription apps, or accessibility tools, experimenting with custom acoustic models for specific languages or noisy environments.",
        "zh": "Moonshine 是一个专为边缘设备优化的开源语音识别系统，能在智能手机和物联网设备等资源受限的环境中实现快速准确的语音转文本。其技术核心在于采用高效的 C 语言算法和模型压缩技术，在显著降低内存和计算需求的同时保持识别精度。开发者可将其集成到嵌入式系统中，用于构建离线语音助手、实时转录应用或无障碍工具，并通过自定义声学模型适配不同语言或嘈杂环境下的实际需求。",
        "es": "Moonshine is an open-source automatic speech recognition system optimized for edge devices like smartphones and IoT gadgets, addressing the challenge of running accurate voice recognition with limited computational resources. Its technical innovation lies in using efficient C-based algorithms and model compression techniques to maintain high accuracy while drastically reducing memory and processing requirements. Developers can integrate it into embedded systems for voice commands, transcription apps, or accessibility tools, experimenting with custom acoustic models for specific languages or noisy environments.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "moonshine gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Moonshine is an open-source automatic speech recognition system optimized for edge devices like smartphones and IoT gadgets, addressing the challenge of running accurate voice recognition with limited computational resources. Its technical innovation lies in using efficient C-based algorithms and model compression techniques to maintain high accuracy while drastically reducing memory and processing requirements. Developers can integrate it into embedded systems for voice commands, transcription apps, or accessibility tools, experimenting with custom acoustic models for specific languages or noisy environments.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/moonshine-ai/moonshine for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
